        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hello, hi!\r\n\r\nDo you mean like in case of `\"('hello world')\"` and cursor on first `'` you would like to `type sr\"` in order to immediately get `\"(\"hello world\")\"`?\r\n\r\nIf yes, what is your expectation to when user wants in this exact initial situation replace the outer `\"` with `]`?",
